[{"s":114,"a":1,"en":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind,","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["أَعُوذُ","I seek refuge"],["بِرَبِّ","in (the) Lord"],["ٱلنَّاسِ","(of) mankind"]]},{"s":93,"a":10,"en":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him].","w":[["وَأَمَّا","And as for"],["ٱلسَّآئِلَ","one who asks"],["فَلَا","then (do) not"],["تَنۡهَرۡ","repel"]]},{"s":72,"a":3,"en":"And [it teaches] that exalted is the nobleness of our Lord; He has not taken a wife or a son","w":[["وَأَنَّهُۥ","And that He"],["تَعَٰلَىٰ","Exalted is"],["جَدُّ","(the) Majesty"],["رَبِّنَا","(of) our Lord"],["مَا","not"],["ٱتَّخَذَ","He has taken"],["صَٰحِبَةٗ","a wife"],["وَلَا","and not"],["وَلَدٗا","a son"]]},{"s":46,"a":14,"en":"Those are the companions of Paradise, abiding eternally therein as reward for what they used to do.","w":[["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","Those"],["أَصۡحَٰبُ","(are the) companions"],["ٱلۡجَنَّةِ","(of) Paradise"],["خَٰلِدِينَ","abiding forever"],["فِيهَا","therein"],["جَزَآءَۢ","a reward"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كَانُواْ","they used to"],["يَعۡمَلُونَ","do"]]},{"s":25,"a":52,"en":"So do not obey the disbelievers, and strive against them with the Qur'an a great striving.","w":[["فَلَا","So (do) not"],["تُطِعِ","obey"],["ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","the disbelievers"],["وَجَٰهِدۡهُم","and strive (against) them"],["بِهِۦ","with it"],["جِهَادٗا","a striving"],["كَبِيرٗا","great"]]},{"s":96,"a":6,"en":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","w":[["كَلَّآ","Nay"],["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","man"],["لَيَطۡغَىٰٓ","surely transgresses"]]},{"s":94,"a":1,"en":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muhammad], your breast?","w":[["أَلَمۡ","Have not"],["نَشۡرَحۡ","We expanded"],["لَكَ","for you"],["صَدۡرَكَ","your breast"]]},{"s":77,"a":31,"en":"[But having] no cool shade and availing not against the flame.\"","w":[["لَّا","No"],["ظَلِيلٖ","cool shade"],["وَلَا","and not"],["يُغۡنِي","availing"],["مِنَ","against"],["ٱللَّهَبِ","the flame"]]},{"s":14,"a":41,"en":"Our Lord, forgive me and my parents and the believers the Day the account is established.\"","w":[["رَبَّنَا","Our Lord"],["ٱغۡفِرۡ","Forgive"],["لِي","me"],["وَلِوَٰلِدَيَّ","and my parents"],["وَلِلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","and the believers"],["يَوۡمَ","(on) the Day"],["يَقُومُ","will (be) established"],["ٱلۡحِسَابُ","the account"]]},{"s":71,"a":11,"en":"He will send [rain from] the sky upon you in [continuing] showers","w":[["يُرۡسِلِ","He will send down"],["ٱلسَّمَآءَ","(rain from) the sky"],["عَلَيۡكُم","upon you"],["مِّدۡرَارٗا","(in) abundance"]]},{"s":39,"a":14,"en":"Say, \"Allah [alone] do I worship, sincere to Him in my religion,","w":[["قُلِ","Say"],["ٱللَّهَ","I worship Allah"],["أَعۡبُدُ","I worship Allah"],["مُخۡلِصٗا","(being) sincere"],["لَّهُۥ","to Him"],["دِينِي","(in) my religion"]]},{"s":13,"a":20,"en":"Those who fulfill the covenant of Allah and do not break the contract,","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who"],["يُوفُونَ","fulfill"],["بِعَهۡدِ","the covenant"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah"],["وَلَا","and not"],["يَنقُضُونَ","they break"],["ٱلۡمِيثَٰقَ","the contract"]]},{"s":78,"a":35,"en":"No ill speech will they hear therein or any falsehood -","w":[["لَّا","Not"],["يَسۡمَعُونَ","they will hear"],["فِيهَا","therein"],["لَغۡوٗا","any vain talk"],["وَلَا","and not"],["كِذَّـٰبٗا","any falsehood"]]},{"s":40,"a":79,"en":"It is Allah who made for you the grazing animals upon which you ride, and some of them you eat.","w":[["ٱللَّهُ","Allah"],["ٱلَّذِي","(is) the One Who"],["جَعَلَ","made"],["لَكُمُ","for you"],["ٱلۡأَنۡعَٰمَ","the cattle"],["لِتَرۡكَبُواْ","that you may ride"],["مِنۡهَا","some of them"],["وَمِنۡهَا","and some of them"],["تَأۡكُلُونَ","you eat"]]},{"s":74,"a":43,"en":"They will say, \"We were not of those who prayed,","w":[["قَالُواْ","They will say"],["لَمۡ","Not"],["نَكُ","we were"],["مِنَ","of"],["ٱلۡمُصَلِّينَ","those who prayed"]]},{"s":43,"a":21,"en":"Or have We given them a book before the Qur'an to which they are adhering?","w":[["أَمۡ","Or"],["ءَاتَيۡنَٰهُمۡ","have We given them"],["كِتَٰبٗا","a book"],["مِّن","before it"],["قَبۡلِهِۦ","before it"],["فَهُم","so they"],["بِهِۦ","to it"],["مُسۡتَمۡسِكُونَ","(are) holding fast"]]},{"s":3,"a":138,"en":"This [Qur'an] is a clear statement to [all] the people and a guidance and instruction for those conscious of Allah.","w":[["هَٰذَا","This"],["بَيَانٞ","(is) a declaration"],["لِّلنَّاسِ","for the people"],["وَهُدٗى","and guidance"],["وَمَوۡعِظَةٞ","and admonition"],["لِّلۡمُتَّقِينَ","for the God-fearing"]]},{"s":111,"a":1,"en":"May the hands of Abu Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.","w":[["تَبَّتۡ","Perish"],["يَدَآ","(the) hands"],["أَبِي","(of) Abu"],["لَهَبٖ","Lahab"],["وَتَبَّ","and perish he"]]},{"s":67,"a":7,"en":"When they are thrown into it, they hear from it a [dreadful] inhaling while it boils up.","w":[["إِذَآ","When"],["أُلۡقُواْ","they are thrown"],["فِيهَا","therein"],["سَمِعُواْ","they will hear"],["لَهَا","from it"],["شَهِيقٗا","an inhaling"],["وَهِيَ","while it"],["تَفُورُ","boils up"]]},{"s":34,"a":35,"en":"And they said, \"We are more [than the believers] in wealth and children, and we are not to be punished.\"","w":[["وَقَالُواْ","And they say"],["نَحۡنُ","We"],["أَكۡثَرُ","(have) more"],["أَمۡوَٰلٗا","wealth"],["وَأَوۡلَٰدٗا","and children"],["وَمَا","and not"],["نَحۡنُ","we"],["بِمُعَذَّبِينَ","will be punished"]]},{"s":91,"a":14,"en":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them].","w":[["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","But they denied him"],["فَعَقَرُوهَا","and they hamstrung her"],["فَدَمۡدَمَ","So destroyed"],["عَلَيۡهِمۡ","them"],["رَبُّهُم","their Lord"],["بِذَنۢبِهِمۡ","for their sin"],["فَسَوَّىٰهَا","and leveled them"]]},{"s":28,"a":62,"en":"And [warn of] the Day He will call them and say, \"Where are My 'partners' which you used to claim?\"","w":[["وَيَوۡمَ","And (the) Day"],["يُنَادِيهِمۡ","He will call them"],["فَيَقُولُ","and say"],["أَيۡنَ","Where"],["شُرَكَآءِيَ","(are) My partners"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","whom"],["كُنتُمۡ","you used (to)"],["تَزۡعُمُونَ","claim"]]},{"s":79,"a":29,"en":"And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness.","w":[["وَأَغۡطَشَ","And He darkened"],["لَيۡلَهَا","its night"],["وَأَخۡرَجَ","and brought out"],["ضُحَىٰهَا","its brightness"]]},{"s":106,"a":4,"en":"Who has fed them, [saving them] from hunger and made them safe, [saving them] from fear.","w":[["ٱلَّذِيٓ","The One Who"],["أَطۡعَمَهُم","feeds them"],["مِّن","[from]"],["جُوعٖ","(against) hunger"],["وَءَامَنَهُم","and gives them security"],["مِّنۡ","from"],["خَوۡفِۭ","fear"]]},{"s":109,"a":2,"en":"I do not worship what you worship.","w":[["لَآ","Not"],["أَعۡبُدُ","I worship"],["مَا","what"],["تَعۡبُدُونَ","you worship"]]},{"s":32,"a":30,"en":"So turn away from them and wait. Indeed, they are waiting.","w":[["فَأَعۡرِضۡ","So turn away"],["عَنۡهُمۡ","from them"],["وَٱنتَظِرۡ","and wait"],["إِنَّهُم","Indeed,they"],["مُّنتَظِرُونَ","(are) waiting"]]},{"s":51,"a":46,"en":"And [We destroyed] the people of Noah before; indeed, they were a people defiantly disobedient.","w":[["وَقَوۡمَ","And (the) people"],["نُوحٖ","(of) Nuh"],["مِّن","before"],["قَبۡلُۖ","before"],["إِنَّهُمۡ","indeed,they"],["كَانُواْ","were"],["قَوۡمٗا","a people"],["فَٰسِقِينَ","defiantly disobedient"]]},{"s":42,"a":41,"en":"And whoever avenges himself after having been wronged - those have not upon them any cause [for blame].","w":[["وَلَمَنِ","And surely whosoever"],["ٱنتَصَرَ","defends himself"],["بَعۡدَ","after"],["ظُلۡمِهِۦ","he has been wronged"],["فَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","then those"],["مَا","not"],["عَلَيۡهِم","(is) against them"],["مِّن","any"],["سَبِيلٍ","way"]]},{"s":2,"a":179,"en":"And there is for you in legal retribution [saving of] life, O you [people] of understanding, that you may become righteous.","w":[["وَلَكُمۡ","And for you"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡقِصَاصِ","the legal retribution"],["حَيَوٰةٞ","(is) life"],["يَـٰٓأُوْلِي","O men"],["ٱلۡأَلۡبَٰبِ","(of) understanding"],["لَعَلَّكُمۡ","So that you may"],["تَتَّقُونَ","(become) righteous"]]},{"s":76,"a":29,"en":"Indeed, this is a reminder, so he who wills may take to his Lord a way.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["هَٰذِهِۦ","this"],["تَذۡكِرَةٞۖ","(is) a reminder"],["فَمَن","so whoever"],["شَآءَ","wills"],["ٱتَّخَذَ","let him take"],["إِلَىٰ","to"],["رَبِّهِۦ","his Lord"],["سَبِيلٗا","a way"]]}]